{"id":6623,"date":"2019-12-14T20:45:45","date_gmt":"2019-12-15T01:45:45","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=6623"},"modified":"2019-12-14T20:45:45","modified_gmt":"2019-12-15T01:45:45","slug":"herbnkathy-solar-install","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2019\/12\/14\/herbnkathy-solar-install\/","title":{"rendered":"herbnkathy solar install"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>While we were on the road this year, I made an appointment with Brian Boone to have our solar power system upgraded when we got back to Arizona.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We set the appointment for November 18th in Quartzsite.  Brian worked for Discount Solar for ten years installing new systems before going out on his own.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191119_151957-1-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6640\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191119_151957-1-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191119_151957-1-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191119_151957-1-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191119_151957-1-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191119_151957-1-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191119_151957-1-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191119_151957-1-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191119_151957-1-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>Welcome to Quartzsite<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Brian and his wife Sue are full-time RV&#8217;ers themselves and travel the country posting their upcoming locations on their <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" aria-label=\"Facebook page (opens in a new tab)\" href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1853280101604978\/\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook page<\/a> so other RV&#8217;ers can make appointments when it works for both.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Since our RV Park at Casa Grande is only 3 hours from Q, it was an easy drive for the day and a half it would take for the install.  Brian was able to make arrangements with a local church to allow us to use their parking lot for the duration.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_070127-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6624\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_070127-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_070127-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_070127-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_070127-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_070127-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_070127-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_070127-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_070127-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>Our first night at the church parking lot<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>After arriving Sunday afternoon in Q, we had dinner at the famous Quartzsite Yacht Club where they had Karaoke and it was a blast!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170407-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6641\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170407-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C1440&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6641\" class=\"wp-image-6641\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170407-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170407-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170407-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170407-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170407-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170407-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170407-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170407-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170427-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6642\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170427-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C1440&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6642\" class=\"wp-image-6642\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170427-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170427-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170427-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170427-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170427-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170427-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170427-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170427-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170632-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6643\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170632-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C1440&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6643\" class=\"wp-image-6643\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170632-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170632-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170632-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170632-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170632-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170632-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170632-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191117_170632-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>I ordered all the equipment for the install from <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" aria-label=\"Continuous Resources (opens in a new tab)\" href=\"https:\/\/www.continuousresources.com\/\" target=\"_blank\">Continuous Resources<\/a> back in October and had it delivered to me at our RV park in plenty of time to load up in the Saturn to take along with us to the install site.  By doing it this way Brian doesn&#8217;t have to carry any bulky, heavy, and high priced inventory.  He does however, carry a wide variety of cables, connectors, and hardware needed to complete the installation.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191116_102046-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6625\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191116_102046-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191116_102046-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191116_102046-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191116_102046-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191116_102046-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191116_102046-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191116_102046-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191116_102046-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>6 solar panels, 2 solar controllers, Inverter, remote panels, switches, and fuses<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The next morning Brian and crew showed up about 8:30, set up their work station and got right to work.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_090543-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6626\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_090543-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C1440&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6626\" class=\"wp-image-6626\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_090543-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_090543-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_090543-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_090543-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_090543-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_090543-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_090543-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_090543-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">We have our easy chairs set up ready to watch<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_090952-1-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6627\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_090952-1-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C1440&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6627\" class=\"wp-image-6627\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_090952-1-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_090952-1-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_090952-1-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_090952-1-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_090952-1-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_090952-1-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_090952-1-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_090952-1-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Brian hauls what he needs in the horse trailer<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_092909-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6628\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_092909-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C1440&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6628\" class=\"wp-image-6628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_092909-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_092909-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_092909-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_092909-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_092909-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_092909-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_092909-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_092909-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The work station<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_105951-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6629\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_105951-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C1440&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6629\" class=\"wp-image-6629\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_105951-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_105951-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_105951-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_105951-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_105951-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_105951-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_105951-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_105951-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Making up the new #8 wire harnesses<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_110530-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6630\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_110530-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C1440&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6630\" class=\"wp-image-6630\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_110530-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_110530-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_110530-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_110530-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_110530-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_110530-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_110530-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191118_110530-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191119_100959-1-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6632\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191119_100959-1-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C1440&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6632\" class=\"wp-image-6632\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191119_100959-1-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191119_100959-1-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191119_100959-1-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191119_100959-1-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191119_100959-1-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191119_100959-1-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191119_100959-1-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191119_100959-1-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Devin working in the battery bay<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/ControllerBay.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6634\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/ControllerBay.jpg?fit=960%2C720&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6634\" class=\"wp-image-6634\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/ControllerBay.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/ControllerBay-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/ControllerBay-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/ControllerBay-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The solar controllers and cut-off switches<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/DevinWorking.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6635\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/DevinWorking.jpg?fit=960%2C720&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6635\" class=\"wp-image-6635\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/DevinWorking.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/DevinWorking-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/DevinWorking-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/DevinWorking-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"405\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/InsideControls.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6636\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/InsideControls.jpg?fit=720%2C960&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6636\" class=\"wp-image-6636\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/InsideControls.jpg 405w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/InsideControls-225x300.jpg 225w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/InsideControls-685x913.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 405px) 100vw, 405px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The remote panels for the inverter and the solar controllers<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/InverterBay.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6637\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/InverterBay.jpg?fit=960%2C720&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6637\" class=\"wp-image-6637\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/InverterBay.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/InverterBay-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/InverterBay-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/InverterBay-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The inverter and 300 amp fuse<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"405\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/Roof1NewInstall.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6639\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/Roof1NewInstall.jpg?fit=720%2C960&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6639\" class=\"wp-image-6639\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/Roof1NewInstall.jpg 405w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/Roof1NewInstall-225x300.jpg 225w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/Roof1NewInstall-685x913.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 405px) 100vw, 405px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Six 200 watt panels installed on the roof<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Since Brian is having a little trouble with his knees lately he solicited the help of his friend Devin to do some of the work that would require kneeling and squatting.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We installed (six) 200 watt Hightec RCL-M200w solar panels on the roof, two Blue Sky 3024i controllers, two power disconnects, fuse, and a Magnum 2000 watt full sine wave inverter.  Both the inverter and the solar controller(s) have remote monitoring and control panels wall mounted in the kitchen.  We mounted these on the wall because we didn&#8217;t have any cabinet conveniently located that we could mount them into.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Our next upgrade will be to replace the four Trojan T-105 flooded cell batteries with four <a href=\"https:\/\/battlebornbatteries.com\/?gclid=CjwKCAiAxMLvBRBNEiwAKhr-nAJCEvUy3TAG9gsrgrTWoijwW_e_gFNjB_8lt92yd3lf0Tp8u7hu9hoCX1MQAvD_BwE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" aria-label=\"Battleborn Lithium 100 amp hour batteries (opens in a new tab)\">Battleborn Lithium 100 amp hour batteries<\/a> but that&#8217;ll be a while since they are so pricey.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"507\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/BattleBorn.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6646\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/BattleBorn.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/BattleBorn-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/BattleBorn-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/BattleBorn-685x457.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/BattleBorn-342x228.jpg 342w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Although the job was finished Tuesday about noon in time for us to make it back to Casa Grande, we decided to stay a 3rd night because a bad wind and rain storm was headed our way.  By early afternoon the temperature dropped about 25 degrees and the wind went from &#8220;still&#8221; to 20-30 mph gusts.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191120_073930-1-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6645\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191120_073930-1-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191120_073930-1-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191120_073930-1-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191120_073930-1-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191120_073930-1-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191120_073930-1-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191120_073930-1-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/12\/20191120_073930-1-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>Look at the sky as the storm was heading in &#8230; eery<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>So we spent another night at the church and then headed on home on Wednesday.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you&#8217;re considering installing or upgrading your solar system, I recommend that you check out <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" aria-label=\"Brian Boone's Got Solar (opens in a new tab)\" href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/gotsolarinstalled\/\" target=\"_blank\">Brian Boone&#8217;s Got Solar<\/a> or <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" aria-label=\"Got Solar? Solar Brian (opens in a new tab)\" href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1853280101604978\/about\/\" target=\"_blank\">Got Solar? Solar Brian<\/a> on Facebook.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you\u2019re not already subscribed to this blog, you can easily do so by scrolling up to the top of any page and entering your email address in the block on the right side.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can also subscribe to our YouTube channel (<a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/results?search_query=herbnkathyrv\" target=\"_blank\">herbnkathyrv<\/a>) on You Tube.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you\u2019re curious (at any time) to know where we are at that moment then click the button at the top right of this page labeled \u201c<a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"http:\/\/aprs.link\/app\/aprs\/stations\/googlemap-WB8BHK-9\" target=\"_blank\">See Where We Are Now<\/a>\u201c.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We\u2019d love to hear from you. If you scroll all the way down to the bottom of this page, you can send us a note. Again, thanks for riding along. \u2019til next time \u2013 safe travels.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>While we were on the road this year, I made an appointment with Brian Boone to have our solar power system upgraded when we got back to Arizona. We set the appointment for November 18th in Quartzsite. Brian worked for Discount Solar for ten years installing new systems before going out on his own. Brian &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2019\/12\/14\/herbnkathy-solar-install\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">herbnkathy solar install<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[18285,554707329],"tags":[554707822,554707821,554707817,554707820,554707254,45212,554707819],"class_list":["post-6623","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-equipment","category-traveling","tag-200-watt","tag-200w","tag-brian-boone","tag-inverter","tag-quartzsite","tag-solar","tag-solar-panels"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/6623","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=6623"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/6623\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":6648,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/6623\/revisions\/6648"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=6623"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=6623"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=6623"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}